1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,498
Every Sunday morning, this bus goes out hunting... for suspects.

2
00:00:03,698 --> 00:00:06,194
Pacific Baptist Church bus route. Let's ride!

3
00:00:06,394 --> 00:00:11,580
Suspect number one: Marcus. Age nine. Known for sprinting out the door with one shoe on.

4
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:15,918
Suspects two and three: the Rivera twins. Still arguing over the window seat.

5
00:00:16,118 --> 00:00:21,167
Suspect number four: Lily. Still in her Halloween costume. Nobody's asking questions.

6
00:00:21,367 --> 00:00:24,564
The bus is loud. The bus is full. The singing is way off key.

7
00:00:24,764 --> 00:00:27,196
Twelve stops. Twenty-three kids. One mission.

8
00:00:27,396 --> 00:00:31,005
Every single one of them, in church. Case closed. See you next Sunday!

